function: Plate comment @8002adbc:
BCM peripheral interrupt pending dispatcher for CP0 IM5.

Behavior:
  - reads parent mask/enable at {@address b4e00050}
  - reads parent status/pending at {@address b4e00054}
  - active = mask & status
  - dispatches each active parent bit through {@symbol 8002ae48}
  - re-enables CP0 Status IM5 after local active bits are drained

Important:
  This function does not prove Host-DQM group 0x30.
  Proven Host-DQM IM5 groups are 0x23..0x28.
  Do not add blind OpenWrt IRQ clear/ack writes from this function alone.

